From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ryan Murray <ryan@aurorasilicon.org>
Date: Fri, 23 Oct 2026 14:14:49 +1100
Subject: [PATCH] arm64: configs: Build J713 from the shared Asahi
 configuration

Every Apple machine builds from one configuration, defconfig plus
asahi.config. The J713 series added two per-device fragments instead,
j713-basic.config and j713-graphics.config.

Enable the five new options in asahi.config: the G16 GPU backend, the
T8132 DCP backend, the retained J713 display DART, the T8132 platform
description handoff (its default follows APPLE_PMP, which is modular
here) and the PMP thermal policy, as a module. Their code is gated on
the T8132 compatibles, so other machines only gain the extra objects.
Drop both fragments, and point the bring-up document and the module
guard at asahi.config.

The J713 bring-up fragment also built the boot storage, input and PMP
drivers in, and enabled userspace options (netfilter, zram, dm-crypt).
The shared configuration keeps the drivers modular, as on the other
machines, so a J713 initramfs must carry them. Userspace options belong
in asahi.config for every machine if they are wanted.

Assisted-by: LLM
Signed-off-by: Ryan Murray <ryan@aurorasilicon.org>
(cherry picked from commit fcc724c92ab329221f456424e0eed507b2fce640)
[dylan: display part only. Took the two asahi.config lines for the
 display, CONFIG_DRM_APPLE_DCP_T8132=y and CONFIG_APPLE_DART_J713_DCP=y.
 Left out DRM_ASAHI_G16, APPLE_PMP_THERMAL and
 APPLE_T8132_PLATFORM_HANDOFF, and the j713-*.config,
 bring-up document and module guard hunks: those files are not in this
 tree. The display code stays gated on the T8132 compatibles and on the
 apple_dart.j713_dcp / j713_display parameters.]
Signed-off-by: Dylan Ironside <dylan@dylanironside.io>
Assisted-by: Claude
---
 arch/arm64/configs/asahi.config | 2 ++
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+)

diff --git a/arch/arm64/configs/asahi.config b/arch/arm64/configs/asahi.config
index 723d46aced..ee74d0611a 100644
--- a/arch/arm64/configs/asahi.config
+++ b/arch/arm64/configs/asahi.config
@@ -52,6 +52,7 @@ CONFIG_DRM_ASAHI_M3_T8122=y
 CONFIG_DRM_ASAHI_G15=y
 CONFIG_DRM_ADP=m
 CONFIG_DRM_APPLE=m
+CONFIG_DRM_APPLE_DCP_T8132=y
 CONFIG_DRM_APPLE_AUDIO=y
 CONFIG_DRM_ACCEL=y
 CONFIG_DRM_ACCEL_ANE=m
@@ -87,6 +88,7 @@ CONFIG_APPLE_SIO_T6030=y
 CONFIG_MFD_MACSMC=m
 CONFIG_COMMON_CLK_APPLE_NCO=m
 CONFIG_APPLE_DART=y
+CONFIG_APPLE_DART_J713_DCP=y
 CONFIG_APPLE_DOCKCHANNEL=m
 CONFIG_SERIAL_APPLE_DOCKCHANNEL=y
 CONFIG_SERIAL_APPLE_DOCKCHANNEL_EARLYCON=y
